# Mira - BusyBox applets to leave out.
#
# BusyBox provides its own modprobe/insmod, and its symlinks are what end up
# in /sbin. It was built without seamless decompression, so it cannot load the
# Pi kernel's xz-compressed modules - vc4 never loaded, there was no /dev/dri,
# and flutter-pi exited with "could not query drm device list" (2026-10-04).
# kmod's tools handle xz; turning BusyBox's off means they are the only ones.
# CONFIG_MODPROBE is not set
# CONFIG_INSMOD is not set
# CONFIG_RMMOD is not set
# CONFIG_LSMOD is not set
# CONFIG_MODINFO is not set
# CONFIG_DEPMOD is not set
